    "description": "Add a Source picklist to Deal identifying which WagerTech property the deal originates from.\n\n=== FIELDS ===\n\n* Source — Source__c — Picklist: Shurzy; Vectiq; WagerTech; PredictiveX\n\n=== IMPLEMENTATION REQUIREMENTS ===\n\n* Values confirmed final for now — decided 2026-08-17: 'We can use these values as the final value set for now.' Shurzy; Vectiq; WagerTech; PredictiveX.\n\n* Restricted picklist. Extend on request — no automation depends on it.\n\n=== OPEN QUESTIONS ===\n\n* Spelling worth eyeballing once: 'Shurzy' and 'Vectiq' come only from Joyce's Slack message and could not be corroborated against any other source. A typo baked into a restricted picklist is annoying to unwind.\n\n=== NOTES ===\n\n* This was a client request that had no ticket until now — Joyce asked in #ext-wagertech-jumpr on Aug 13 15:04 ('Let's add Source to deals - Shurzy, Vectiq, WagerTech, PredictiveX'), it got a thumbs-up reaction and nothing else happened.\n\n=== SOURCE ===\n\n* Slack Joyce Aug 13 15:04 #ext-wagertech-jumpr\n\nDependencies: None\n\nOwner (proposed): TBD\n\nRemember to update the requirements documentation as part of this change.\n\nCreated 2026-08-17 from the Operator/Partner ticket review, approved by Kobi.",
